        <UserObject id="filter" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:29px;font-weight:bold;color:#7042a6;line-height:1.2&quot;&gt;可行性筛选 ↗&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:24px;color:#3d5264;line-height:1.42;margin-top:14px&quot;&gt;语义、功能、容量与预算&lt;br&gt;严格约束可排除不可能&lt;br&gt;近似低收益预测保留探索&lt;/div&gt;" link="https://github.com/Sunhuahai/llm-inference-theory/blob/main/optimizer/search-space/README.md" linkTarget="_blank" tooltip="optimizer/search-space/README.md">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=24;spacingTop=20;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b39ace;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="2255" y="800" width="650" height="190" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
