        <UserObject id="communication" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:29px;font-weight:bold;color:#2459a6;line-height:1.2&quot;&gt;通信与执行重叠 ↗&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:24px;color:#3d5264;line-height:1.42;margin-top:14px&quot;&gt;聚合、放置、预取与流水&lt;br&gt;改变 C、依赖和暴露路径&lt;br&gt;代价：缓冲区、竞争与排空&lt;/div&gt;" link="https://github.com/Sunhuahai/llm-inference-theory/blob/main/theory/execution/README.md" linkTarget="_blank" tooltip="theory/execution/README.md">
