        <UserObject id="pareto" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:29px;font-weight:bold;color:#a96612;line-height:1.2&quot;&gt;多目标选择与独立验证 ↗&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:24px;color:#3d5264;line-height:1.42;margin-top:14px&quot;&gt;TTFT／TPOT／goodput／成本&lt;br&gt;可行候选的 Pareto 前沿&lt;br&gt;冻结评价规则并留出复测&lt;/div&gt;" link="https://github.com/Sunhuahai/llm-inference-theory/blob/main/optimizer/evaluation/README.md" linkTarget="_blank" tooltip="optimizer/evaluation/README.md">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=24;spacingTop=20;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dfbb7c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="2255" y="1580" width="650" height="190" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject id="couplings" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:29px;font-weight:bold;color:#2459a6;line-height:1.2&quot;&gt;典型耦合：为什么必须重算 ↗&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:24px;color:#3d5264;line-height:1.42;margin-top:14px&quot;&gt;缓存 × batch：少重算，也可能挤占活跃状态空间&lt;br&gt;融合 × 映射：少搬运，也可能 spill 或降低并发&lt;br&gt;并行 × 副本：单副本更快，也可能减少服务副本&lt;/div&gt;" link="https://github.com/Sunhuahai/llm-inference-theory/blob/main/theory/optimization/coupling.md" linkTarget="_blank" tooltip="theory/optimization/coupling.md">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=24;spacingTop=20;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8caee0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="95" y="2070" width="1370" height="230" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject id="search" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:29px;font-weight:bold;color:#7042a6;line-height:1.2&quot;&gt;搜索与经验更新 ↗&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:24px;color:#3d5264;line-height:1.42;margin-top:14px&quot;&gt;结合收益、成本和不确定性选择实现、补测或停止&lt;br&gt;保存失败、负结果、机制反例与可迁移的适用域&lt;br&gt;为新瓶颈生成下一批候选；完整代码进化仍属研究设计&lt;/div&gt;" link="https://github.com/Sunhuahai/llm-inference-theory/blob/main/optimizer/planning/README.md" linkTarget="_blank" tooltip="optimizer/planning/README.md">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=24;spacingTop=20;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b39ace;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1535" y="2070" width="1370" height="230" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
